  X    = 0x0340
  P    = 0x34
Video registers:
status 0
action none
$ regs cpu
out 59
No debug CPU named 'cpu' on this GOLDEN. Available: (none).
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ regs
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

